OL,3,GNEWSAAberdeen's Union Square shopping
OL,4,Acentre put on the market for #175m
OL,5,
OL,6,FAberdeen's Union Square shopping centre
OL,7,Fhas been put up for sale for #175m,
OL,8,Fjust two-and-a-half years after it was
OL,9,Fbought by a US private equity firm.
OL,11,FLone Star purchased the site for #111m
OL,12,Fin March 2024 but the reason for the
OL,13,Flatest sale is unclear.
OL,15,FThe move comes after a major Marks and
OL,16,FSpencer (M&S) expansion and several new
OL,17,Fstore openings.
OL,19,FEstate agent Knight Frank described
OL,20,FUnion Square as a "huge success story"
OL,21,Fand a "thriving retail asset".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
